      "id": "lem-it-quantum-relative-entropy-support-regularization",
      "check": "General PSD including zero-space/support failure retained; spectral kernel coefficient positive iff failed support inclusion. Fixed invalid native endpoint squeeze to 2(sqrt(t)-t) using the actual published log bound; no supplier edits."
