    },
    {
      "id": "thm-it-quantum-relative-entropy-partial-trace-data-processing",
      "check": "Actual uniform twirl uses positive finite weights and unitaries; canonical joint convexity and invariance meet hypotheses. Tensor-I/d logarithmic shifts cancel even for unequal traces; support/infinity handled. Refreshed exact joint supplier quote only."
    },
    {
      "id": "thm-it-quantum-relative-entropy-partial-trace-dpi",
      "check": "Same uniform twirl compatibility; remapped to canonical joint supplier. Tensor support/eigenvalue trace cancellation preserved. Adopted normative formatting/step-order proposal, no mathematical clause changed."
    },
    {
      "id": "thm-it-quantum-relative-entropy-channel-data-processing",
      "check": "Finite Kraus dilation is isometric using trace-preserving normalization; nonzero input forces nonempty environment. Invariance plus partial trace yields claimed generalPSD extended inequality."
    },
    {
      "id": "thm-it-quantum-relative-entropy-data-processing-finite",
      "check": "Actual finite Stinespring hypothesis supplies isometry/environment; nonzero input forces nonzero environment. Canonical invariance and local partial trace suffice. Joined proof paragraphs for normative precheck."
    },
    {
      "id": "thm-it-quantum-relative-entropy-nonnegative-equality",
      "check": "Claim explicitly restricted to density operators; singleton POVM yields scalar1 comparison, all projective measurement distributions yield equality only for equal quadratic forms, polarization under linear-first convention recovers equality. No genericPSD nonnegativity inferred."
    },
    {
      "id": "thm-it-holevo-measurement-bound",
      "check": "Read branch-support inclusion and finite POVM-channel DPI argument; zero p omitted and q>=p*w handles denominator. Corrected average-QRE trace difference to sum p tr(rho ln rho) minus tr(bar ln bar)=chi. Statement unchanged; no logical consumers currently."
    },
    {
      "id": "thm-it-finite-strong-subadditivity",
      "check": "Actual support lemma and entropy identities ensure both relative entropies finite before cancellation. Partial trace of rho_A tensor rho_BC is rho_A tensor rho_B by ordered matrix blocks; inequality rearranges to SSA. Formatting only."
    },
    {
      "id": "thm-it-finite-quantum-conditional-mutual-information-nonnegative",
      "check": "Read actual CMI definition and ACB permutation proof; unitary spectral invariance and reordered marginal sums transfer SSA with C as conditioning/middle factor. No convention change."
    },
    {
      "id": "ex-it-dephasing-quantum-relative-entropy-dpi",
      "check": "Read channel positivity/trace proof and qubit spectra. Explicit divergences .5ln(16/3) and .5ln(4/3), orthogonal-pure infinity to0 example correctly apply same generalPSD support convention."
    },
    {
      "id": "ex-it-strong-subadditivity-for-pure-tripartite-state",
      "check": "Read GHZ marginal calculation; offdiagonal partial traces vanish, two positive marginal eigenvalues1/2 give ln2, pure joint entropy0; strict SSA2ln2>ln2. Normative phase label/reference remap only."
